      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "两种状态各有尺寸",
        "en": "Dimensions for both arrangements"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/AZL897/c3302158a7a3.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "组合球门尺寸140 × 110 × 69 cm，小球门尺寸72 × 66 × 36 cm，配球直径18 cm。规划场地时，可根据所选状态预留正面踢球距离。",
        "en": "The combined goal measures 140 × 110 × 69 cm; the smaller goal measures 72 × 66 × 36 cm. The included ball is 18 cm in diameter. Leave kicking space for the arrangement selected."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "以组合结构核对配置",
        "en": "Check the combination version"
